  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pacific Climate Change Initiative - Pac-CCI</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Action&#xbf;s overall objective is that PICs are resilient to climate change impacts and transition to a low carbon economy. Accordingly, the Action is to be developed across two distinct but interacting components. Component 1 aims to make PICs school infrastructure and education systems more resilient to climate change and develop a regional facility to tackle investments, learning, and capacity building in school infrastructure maintenance and upgrading/retrofitting for resilience. Component 2 will support the Regional Pacific NDC Hub&#xbf;s fourth programming phase. The Pacific NDC Hub has been essential to help PICs develop their climate strategies and actions and will continue to do so under the new phase.</narrative>
  </description>
